[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:77. Terrible Toothache]
[00:00.800]Lesson 77 | 第77课
[00:03.310]Good morning, Mr. Croft. | 早上好，克罗夫特先生。
[00:06.375]Good morning, nurse. | 早上好，护士。
[00:08.105]I want to see the dentist, please. | 我想看牙医，拜托了。
[00:10.750]Have you an appointment? | 您有预约吗？
[00:12.755]No, I haven't. | 不，我没有。
[00:14.255]Is it urgent? | 很紧急吗？
[00:15.735]Yes, it is. | 是的，很紧急。
[00:17.035]It's very urgent. | 非常紧急。
[00:18.760]I feel awful. | 我感觉糟透了。
[00:20.550]I have a terrible toothache. | 我牙疼得厉害。
[00:23.150]Can you come at 10 a.m. on Monday, April the 24th? | 您能4月24日星期一上午10点来吗？
[00:28.605]I must see the dentist now, nurse. | 护士，我必须现在就去看牙医。
[00:31.370]The dentist is very busy at the moment. | 牙医目前非常忙。
[00:35.165]Can you come at 2 p.m.? | 您能下午2点来吗？
[00:38.260]That's very late. | 那太晚了。
[00:40.260]Can't the dentist see me now? | 牙医不能现在就见我吗？
[00:42.645]I'm afraid that he can't, Mr. Croft. | 恐怕他现在不能，克罗夫特先生。
[00:45.955]Can't you wait till this afternoon? | 您不能等到今天下午吗？
[00:49.105]I can wait, | 我可以等，
[00:50.640]but my toothache can't. | 但我的牙痛等不了。